st','Iron for the Forge','A New Edge','A Living Town'][state.quest]}</strong><p>${['Find Traveler Edda by the old bridge.','Take the ore Edda gave you to Khan’s forge.','Use the smithy to craft an Ironbound Sabre.','Winston’s future is being shaped by your actions.'][state.quest]}</p></div><div class="journal-entry"><strong>World Chronicle · Day 1</strong><p>${document.querySelector('#pulseText').textContent}</p></div>`}else if(type==='world'){content.innerHTML=`<div class="modal-kicker">WEST CONTINENT · YOUR WORLD</div><h1 class="modal-title">The world is wide.</h1><p class="modal-description">This is a living region on a continent without borders. Discover routes, help communities, and decide what thrives. Select a destination to travel.</p><div class="world-map"><span class="continent-label west-label">WEST CONTINENT</span><span class="continent-label east-label">EAST CONTINENT</span><span class="sea-label">RED SEA</span><span class="map-location" style="left:25%;top:38%" data-name="Winston · Here"></span><span class="map-location" style="left:18%;top:70%" data-name="Bairan · 18 gold"></span><span class="map-location" style="left:34%;top:65%" data-name="Reidan · Beyond the sands"></span><span class="map-location" style="left:73%;top:45%" data-name="Pangea · Uncharted"></span></div><div class="world-map-legend"><span>West Continent · 560m region loaded</span><span>⏱ 3:1 world time</span></div><button class="event-choice" id="worldEvent"><b>Community decision · Winston</b>Choose what the people should prioritize next. Your choice changes local prosperity and reputation.</button>`;content.querySelector('#worldEvent').onclick=()=>openModal('decision')}else if(type==='decision'){content.innerHTML=`<div class="modal-kicker">PLAYER-DRIVEN WORLD · WINSTON</div><h1 class="modal-title">What should Winston become?</h1><p class="modal-description">The town council has asked you to guide the next community effort. Every decision has lasting consequences.</p><button class="event-choice" data-choice="forge"><b>Restore Khan’s forge</b>Invest 4 gold. Smithing output rises; Khan’s affinity and local industry improve.</button><button class="event-choice" data-choice="road"><b>Repair the trade road</b>Invest 3 gold. Increase prosperity and make future caravans safer.</button><button class="event-choice" data-choice="fields"><b>Support the outer farms</b>Invest 2 gold. Improve food supply and attract new residents.</button>`;content.querySelectorAll('[data-choice]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>worldDecision(b.dataset.choice))}}
